sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Orch as Orchestrator
  participant WDB as workflow schema
  participant CDC as Debezium
  participant Kafka
  participant API as Control API
  participant PDB as projection schema

  Orch->>Orch: Classify safe retry exhaustion at attempt 8
  Orch->>WDB: Begin fenced terminal transaction
  Orch->>WDB: Mark workflow and operation failed
  Orch->>WDB: Complete command receipt
  Orch->>WDB: Insert sanitized dead letter
  Orch->>WDB: Insert provisioning.dlq.v1 outbox fact
  Orch->>WDB: Insert attributed audit entry + audit fact
  WDB-->>Orch: Commit all terminal evidence atomically
  Orch->>Orch: End dead-letter span + increment counter

  CDC->>WDB: Read committed DLQ outbox row
  CDC-)Kafka: Publish dead-letter fact with W3C headers
  Kafka-)API: Deliver provisioning.dlq.v1 record
  API->>PDB: Insert admin projection + inbox receipt atomically
  PDB-->>API: Commit
  API->>Kafka: Commit offset

  Note over Orch,PDB: Payloads and reasons stay in owner storage while exported telemetry carries bounded classifications only.
